Package: statmodels7
Title: The S7 Toolkit for Statistical Modeling
Version: 0.232.0
Authors@R:
    person("Giovanni", "Tinervia", , "giovannitinervia9@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits distributional regression models, and installs and attaches
    the eight packages of the statmodels7 toolkit that supply their parts: a
    numerical layer, link functions, probability distributions, constrained
    parameters, basis expansions, penalties, model terms and optimization
    algorithms, all built on the S7 object system. One formula carries an
    equation per parameter of the response distribution, so a scale or a
    shape is modeled as readily as a mean. Smoothing parameters and prior
    scales are estimated by a marginal criterion or by prediction error.
    Installing this package installs all eight members, attaching it attaches
    all eight, and it reports which are out of date and which of their
    exports mask one another.
